```properties
# ==========================================================
# Caroline 2.4.0 - Gradle Properties
# ==========================================================

# AndroidX
android.useAndroidX=true

# Kotlin code style
kotlin.code.style=official

# Gradle performance
org.gradle.daemon=true
org.gradle.parallel=true
org.gradle.caching=true

# JVM memory
org.gradle.jvmargs=-Xmx2048m -Dfile.encoding=UTF-8

# Kotlin build settings
kotlin.incremental=true

# Android build settings
android.nonTransitiveRClass=true
android.nonFinalResIds=true

# Project information
caroline.versionName=2.4.0
caroline.versionCode=20400
caroline.appName=Caroline
```

Save it at:

```text
Caroline/
├── gradle.properties
├── settings.gradle.kts
├── version.properties
├── build.gradle.kts
└── app/
    └── build.gradle.kts
```

This is compatible with the Android/Compose project structure we've been building.
